{
  "id": 340000250,
  "name": "Sigillum",
  "desc": "A wordless black mech, lost and longing to return home.",
  "desc_open": "This enemy has a <color=HighlightB>higher RES</color> to <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nWhen hit by an Echo Skill, Sigillum gains 1 stack of Off Course, up to 5 stacks. Echoes with the same name can only trigger this effect once.\nEach stack of Off Course makes it take 10% more total DMG. At 5 stacks, Sigillum takes an additional 30% total DMG.\n\nRage and tears. Suffering and joy. Sorrow and pain. All are condensed, along with her sigh, into a single golden frequency.\nIt gazes at the sky, lost in memories worn thin by the ages. The lost voyager is still searching for the way home.",
